              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kiira Ekanaanit, ekabaka loka Arad, loeboienenei kari naka eŋalakimak, ebe ebunit Isirael korot loka Atarim; kitiji Isirael, konata ice kakesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
