        },
        {
          "text": " Kodany Isirael ŋes kakwanis naka ekileŋ, kirum akekwap anyoun koArunon aitodol Yabok, aitodol odwe luka Amon: naarai agogoŋ eikor loka idwe luka Amon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
