        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema EJAKAIT Musa atiar, “Sirikiyoŋ ŋes: naarai akorak ŋes toma akanikon, ka iketuŋa kere, ka akekwap da; iswamakini ŋes kwape ibu kiswamakinia Sikon ekabaka loka Imorain, lueboienenete koKesibon.” ",
